ysis of mortality events associated with a prespecified fixed point</article-title><source>J R Stat Soc Ser A Stat Soc</source><year>1993</year><volume>156</volume><fpage>363</fpage><lpage>377</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12159125</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2307/2983063</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>